the schema has 3 problem(s):
  - posts: the INSERT policy needs WITH CHECK and no USING
  - posts: the UPDATE policy needs both USING and WITH CHECK
  - posts: two row-level security policies govern SELECT

the schema has 1 problem(s):
  - posts: row-level security is Postgres's; on SQLite the database layer alone enforces policies
